  "bio": "Vinnie Lei is a masterful tattoo artist who specializes in the intricate and vibrant Japanese style. Through meticulous attention to detail, Vinnie ensures each piece is a true work of art, reflecting both the rich tradition of the genre and the personal essence of the client. Operating out of La Orotava, Spain, Vinnie's high standards for professionalism are evident in every aspect of the tattooing experience, inviting clientele into a space where artistry meets exceptional service.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: La Orotava, Canary Islands, Spain"
